0 // Description: Short 6 x 8 stud kart floor over 42610/50951 wheels on 4488 holders; fixed axles.
0 // Parts: 33 (all inside the grouped submodel compact-kart-base.ldr)
0 // Wheels: 4 (rim + tyre pairs on two axles)
0 // Bounds LDU: x -62..62, y -60..24, z -80..80 (size 124 x 84 x 160)
0 // Front / bow towards -Z, -Y up. The whole base is one submodel reference: move it as one piece.
1 16 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 compact-kart-base.ldr
0 NOFILE
